{
    "title": "Easy Control AZ",
    "description": "Easy Control AZ is a unique phone customizer and quickly helps you to change settings, night mode, lock screen, volume controller, turn on Wi-Fi and more. Personalize your phone to design easily with a powerful control! You can have an experience of using a newest and modern phone with your current android phone.\r\nFantastic Easy Control AZ - Customize Your Device!\r\nQuick access to the camera, flashlight, and other settings in the Control. Powerful options to customize your mobile with quick access to settings.\r\nEasy Control for Your Android Device!\r\nYou can change your phone design very easily and in a few steps, then configure everything to your preferences.\r\nKey super-convenient feature of Easy Control AZ:\r\nInstant access to Music Player, Camera, Flash, Calculator, Wifi, Data 4G, Screen brightness and other settings is now all possible with Easy Control AZ.\r\nMusic app setting & control from Easy Control AZ. By using a control center with full function, your phone will be like a brand new phone with a nice and streamlined design.\r\nWith Easy Control AZ, you can quickly access multiple settings:\r\nNew background\r\nWi-Fi: you can turn on or turn off Wifi easily and even search for new Wifi network\r\nBluetooth: enable Bluetooth function easily, quick connect to headphone, car system or other Bluetooth devices\r\nPortrait Orientation Lock: Keep your screen from rotating when you move your device.\r\nDo Not Disturb: Silence calls, alerts, and notifications that you receive while your device is locked.\r\nVolume adjust: quick and super-easy adjust volume by swiping up and down.\r\nBrightness adjust: swipe up for brighter screen and swipe down for darker screen.\r\nCamera: one click to get your camera, instant access to capture all your precious moments.\r\nAlarm & Timer: Set an alarm, timer, or stopwatch, or check the time in another country or region.\r\nFlashlight: The LED flash on your camera doubles as a flashlight when you need it by quick access\r\nCalculator: easy using and quick access to your calculator\r\nMusic player & audio control: just by one click, you can quickly play, pause, and control volume of your favorite song, podcast, and more.\r\nNOTE\r\nACCESSIBILITY SERVICE\r\nThis app uses ACCESSIBILITY SERVICE\r\nThis application requires activation in the accessibility service to display the Control view on the mobile screen.\r\nAdditionally, this app utilizes accessibility service functionalities such as control music, control volume, and dismissing system dialogs, among other features.\r\nThis application does not accumulate or disclose any user information about this accessibility right.\r\nNo user data is stored by this application about this accessibility right.\r\n\r\nDisclaimers\r\nAll product names, logos, brands, trademarks and registered trademarks, which are not owned by us, are property of their respective owners\r\nAll company, product and service names used in this app are for identification purposes only. Use of these names, trademarks and brands does not imply endorsement.\r\nThis app is owned by us. We are not affiliated, associated, authorized, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with any 3rd party apps or companies.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd3bFeedback\r\nWe hope you will like this app and support it.\r\nWe will be happy if you give your feedback to improve this application.\r\nIf you need help for using feature or have some suggestion, Please contact us via: support@appsgenz.com\r\nThank you and best regards!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Easy Control AZ is a unique phone customizer and quickly helps you to change settings, night mode, lock screen, volume controller, turn on Wi-Fi and more. Personalize your phone to design easily with a powerful control! You can have an experience of using a newest and modern phone with your current android phone.<br>Fantastic Easy Control AZ - Customize Your Device!<br>Quick access to the camera, flashlight, and other settings in the Control. Powerful options to customize your mobile with quick access to settings.<br>Easy Control for Your Android Device!<br>You can change your phone design very easily and in a few steps, then configure everything to your preferences.<br>Key super-convenient feature of Easy Control AZ:<br>Instant access to Music Player, Camera, Flash, Calculator, Wifi, Data 4G, Screen brightness and other settings is now all possible with Easy Control AZ.<br>Music app setting &amp; control from Easy Control AZ. By using a control center with full function, your phone will be like a brand new phone with a nice and streamlined design.<br>With Easy Control AZ, you can quickly access multiple settings:<br>New background<br>Wi-Fi: you can turn on or turn off Wifi easily and even search for new Wifi network<br>Bluetooth: enable Bluetooth function easily, quick connect to headphone, car system or other Bluetooth devices<br>Portrait Orientation Lock: Keep your screen from rotating when you move your device.<br>Do Not Disturb: Silence calls, alerts, and notifications that you receive while your device is locked.<br>Volume adjust: quick and super-easy adjust volume by swiping up and down.<br>Brightness adjust: swipe up for brighter screen and swipe down for darker screen.<br>Camera: one click to get your camera, instant access to capture all your precious moments.<br>Alarm &amp; Timer: Set an alarm, timer, or stopwatch, or check the time in another country or region.<br>Flashlight: The LED flash on your camera doubles as a flashlight when you need it by quick access<br>Calculator: easy using and quick access to your calculator<br>Music player &amp; audio control: just by one click, you can quickly play, pause, and control volume of your favorite song, podcast, and more.<br>NOTE<br>ACCESSIBILITY SERVICE<br>This app uses ACCESSIBILITY SERVICE<br>This application requires activation in the accessibility service to display the Control view on the mobile screen.<br>Additionally, this app utilizes accessibility service functionalities such as control music, control volume, and dismissing system dialogs, among other features.<br>This application does not accumulate or disclose any user information about this accessibility right.<br>No user data is stored by this application about this accessibility right.<br><br>Disclaimers<br>All product names, logos, brands, trademarks and registered trademarks, which are not owned by us, are property of their respective owners<br>All company, product and service names used in this app are for identification purposes only. Use of these names, trademarks and brands does not imply endorsement.<br>This app is owned by us. We are not affiliated, associated, authorized, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with any 3rd party apps or companies.<br><br>\ud83d\udd3bFeedback<br>We hope you will like this app and support it.<br>We will be happy if you give your feedback to improve this application.<br>If you need help for using feature or have some suggestion, Please contact us via: support@appsgenz.com<br>Thank you and best regards!",
